{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,200p' data/accounting-master/deliverables/P04/result.md; wc -l scripts/reconstruction_v1.py scripts/rational_solver_v1.py scripts/check_accounting_p04.py tests/test_accounting_p04.py\"","aggregated_output":"# P04 bounded reconstruction result\n\nPASS: 21 P04 tests executed; observations cover 21/21 catalogued obligations; 11 P03 regression tests executed. Full executed outcomes, formulas, cell assignments, witnesses, conflicts, source hashes and proof queries are in conformance.json.\n\nThe current recovery accepts explicit supervisor approval and execution-inventory paths, checks approval structure and plan-hash integrity, and retains the original design and historical inventory separately. Four checker obligations exercise malformed or unapproved inputs, rejection before writes, current manifest selection, unchanged protection exclusions and failure reporting in disposable trees. Their simulated test outcomes concern reporting behavior only; the reconstruction tests supply the numerical evidence below.\n\nDeclared templates construct account and economic-state roll-forwards. Independent Fraction enumeration checks three finite input variants; a selected Northstar receivables bridge replays original events to create observations before reconstruction. P03 integration preserves alpha=1/2, isolates endpoint conditions, retains overlapping views and rejects incompatible joint extrema. Parent coverage remains one continuous cell without genuine choices.\n\nExact debt interest ranges from 5 to 7. The rounded fixture has infimum 199/40, attained, and supremum 1407/200, unattained. Original strict feasibility precedes closure optimisation. Half-even negative ties, posting minor units, integer gaps, source conflicts, unsupported arithmetic, zero budgets and injected Unknown responses are checked. Incomplete search retains domains, predicates, ordinals and formulas